  data: {
    LLM: "Prioritize playing your 'strong suite' (the number you have the most of) to communicate your strength to your partner.\n\nIf your partner leads a suit, try to 'keep it open' by matching the other end of the board to a different number, or play back to the same suit.\n\nCounting: With only 28 tiles, you should track exactly how many of each suit (0-6) have been played. If your opponent has passed on a specific number, try to 'starve' them by keeping that number on the layout ends.",
    Player: "Prioritize playing your 'strong suite' (the number you have the most of) to communicate your strength to your partner.\n\nIf your partner leads a suit, try to 'keep it open' by matching the other end of the board to a different number, or play back to the same suit.\n\nCounting: With only 28 tiles, you should track exactly how many of each suit (0-6) have been played. If your opponent has passed on a specific number, try to 'starve' them by keeping that number on the layout ends.",
